The JSON Schema files in this directory and its wire/ subdirectory are copied
unmodified from policy-engine/spec/schema/ in the Agent Governance Toolkit repository
(https://github.com/microsoft/agent-governance-toolkit, commit c767f83).
They are used as data, to validate policy manifests before importing them.
They are not part of AgentFox's Apache-2.0 licensed source.

That directory is distributed under the MIT License below. The repository also
preserves an upstream notice (policy-engine/LICENSE.acs) for specification and
schema files that originated in the Agent Control Specification project; it is
reproduced after the first notice.

